[I] Perl version of Nilsimsa code

[T] Digest::Nilsimsa is a Perl module computing Nilsimsa digests, a locality
[T] sensitive hash where similar inputs produce similar digests. It is
[T] mainly used for detecting spam and near-duplicate texts and contains C
[T] code from nilsimsa 0.2.4.

